<section class="panel panel-pad" style="margin-top:18px"><h2>Additional registry stop: full-footprint witness &amp; synthetic 5-px lattice</h2><p>A pinned continuous diagnostic has positive support on all 5,167,373 mirrored footprint cells, and synthetic grid <code>13gems_r13-lattice-s5</code> covers 99.87% of footprint cells within 3 px. Under the shared template’s literal positive-cell-as-dot rule, every nonempty 37,654-dot candidate exceeds 70% overlap against those synthetic probes (Pigeonhole lower bound 82.16%). Both literal and detector-lane readings are reported side by side without silent exemption.</p><p><a href="data/registry_saturation.json">View the reproducible certificate ↗</a> · <a href="research.html">Scientific review ↗</a> · <a href="data/recovery-run-card.json">Recovery-session run card ↗</a></p></section>

